@model Msr.Services.EquipmentMaintenances.ViewModels.CreateEquipmentMaintenanceViewModel

        @using (Html.BeginForm("AddEquipmentMaintenance", "Wip", FormMethod.Post, new { @class = "form-horizontal add-equipment-maintenace" }))
        {
            @Html.Partial("Message")

            <fieldset>
                <input type="hidden" name="id" value="@ViewBag.FillId " />
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="scancode">Scan Barcode</label>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        @Html.EditorFor(model => model.ScanBarcode, new { htmlAttributes = new { @class = "form-control input-md", @placeholder = "Put cursor here to scan" } })
                        @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.ScanBarcode, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                        <span class="help-block">Or Manually select Location beolow</span>
                        <div class="alert alert-info">Entry of barcode above will update the select values below on match</div>
                        <div id="error" class="alert alert-danger"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="selectbasic">Primary Location</label>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        @Html.DropDownListFor(model => model.PrimaryLocationId, Model.PrimaryLocationList, "Select a Location", new { @class = "form-control" })
                        @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.PrimaryLocationId, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="Sublocation1">Select Sublocation 1</label>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        @Html.DropDownListFor(model => model.SubLocationFirstId, Model.SubLocationFirstList, new { @class = "form-control" })
                        @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.SubLocationFirstId, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="Sublocation2">Select Sublocation 2</label>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        @Html.DropDownListFor(model => model.SubLocationSecondId, Model.SubLocationSecondList, "Select a Sublocation", new { @class = "form-control" })
                        @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.SubLocationSecondId, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="DateTime">Date/Time</label>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div style="width: 70%;float: left">
                        @Html.EditorFor(model => model.DateTime, new {htmlAttributes = new {@class = "form-control datepick ", @placeholder = "Current Date Time", @style = "",}})
                        </div>
                        <div style="width: 30%; height: 35px;float: left">
                            <span class="input-group-addon"><i class="fa fa-calendar" style="height: 19px;"></i></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="EquipmentTroubleState">Trouble State</label>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div class="checkbox">
                            <label for="EquipmentState-0">
                                @Html.CheckBoxFor(model => model.TroubleState, new { @class = "checkbox" })
                                @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.TroubleState, "", new { @class = "text-danger" })
                                Yes
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                @if (Model.CanAddPreventativeEm)
                {
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="DateTime">PM Last Completed Date</label>
                    <div class="col-md-4">
                        <div style="width: 70%;float: left">
                            @Html.EditorFor(model => model.PMLastCompletedDate, new {htmlAttributes = new {@class = "form-control datepick ", @placeholder = "PM Last Completed Date", @style = "",}})
                        </div>
                        <div style="width: 30%; height: 35px;float: left">
                            <span class="input-group-addon"><i class="fa fa-calendar" style="height: 19px;"></i></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
               
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="scancode">Frequency Field:</label>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            @Html.EditorFor(model => model.FrequencyField, new {htmlAttributes = new {@class = "form-control input-md", @placeholder = ""}})
                            @Html.ValidationMessageFor(model => model.FrequencyField, "", new {@class = "text-danger"})
                        </div>
                    </div>
                }
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label class="col-md-4 control-label" for="comments">Comments</label>
                        <div class="col-md-4">
                            @Html.TextAreaFor(model => model.Comments, new {@class = "form-control input-md", @placeholder = "Enter you comments"})
                        </div>
                    </div>
                
            </fieldset>
        }

<script src="~/assets/js/moment.min.js"></script>
<script src="~/assets/js/bootstrap-datetimepicker.min.js"></script>
<script type="text/javascript" src="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/jquery.validate.js")"></script>
<script type="text/javascript" src="@Url.Content("~/Scripts/jquery.validate.unobtrusive.min.js")"></script>
<script type="text/javascript">

    $(document).ready(function () {

        $('#add-equipment-maintenace').on('click', function () {
                    $('.add-equipment-maintenace').submit();
            });

        $('#error').hide();
        $('.datepick').datetimepicker();

        $('.dateSelecter').click(function (parameters) {
            $(this).find('.datepick').focus();
        });
        $('#ScanBarcode').on('keyup', function () {
            if ($(this).val().length > 3) {

                var id = $(this).val();
                $.ajax({
                    type: "POST",
                    url: "/EquipmentMaintenance/GetChildLocations/" + id,
                    success: function (data) {
                        if (data.locations === "") {
                            $('#error').html('Location not found select manually');
                            $('#error').show();
                            $('#PrimaryLocationId').prop('selectedIndex', 0);
                            $("#SubLocationFirstId").empty();
                            $("#SubLocationSecondId").empty();

                            $("#SubLocationFirstId").prop('disabled', true);
                            $("#SubLocationSecondId").prop('disabled', true);


                        } else {
                            $("#SubLocationFirstId").empty();
                            $("#SubLocationSecondId").empty();
                            console.log(data.locations);
                            if (data.locations !== "") {
                                $.each(data.locations, function (i, row) {
                                    $("#SubLocationSecondId").append("<option value='" + row.Value + "'>" + row.Text + "</option>");
                                });
                                var id1 = $("#SubLocationSecondId").val();
                                $.ajax({
                                    type: 'POST',
                                    url: "/EquipmentMaintenance/GetSecoundLocations/" + id1,
                                    success: function (data) {
                                        $.each(data.locations,
                                            function (i, row) {
                                                $("#SubLocationFirstId")
                                                    .append("<option value='" + row.Value + "'>" + row.Text + "</option>");
                                            });

                                        var id2 = $("#SubLocationFirstId").val();
                                        if (id2 == null) {
                                            alert("Location not found select manually");
                                        } else {
                                            $.ajax({
                                                type: 'POST',
                                                url: "/EquipmentMaintenance/GetParentLocations/" + id2,
                                                success: function (data) {
                                                    var parentLocation = data.locations;
                                                    console.log(parentLocation);

                                                    //$("#PrimaryLocationId option:selected").prop("selected", false);
                                                    //$("#PrimaryLocationId option").filter(function () {
                                                    //    console.log(this.text == parentLocation);
                                                    //    console.log(parentLocation);
                                                    //    return this.text == parentLocation;
                                                    //}).attr('selected', true);
                                                    var index;
                                                    $("#PrimaryLocationId option").each(function (i) {
                                                        if (this.text === parentLocation) {
                                                            index = i;
                                                            return this.text === parentLocation;
                                                        }
                                                    }).attr('selected', true);
                                                    $('#PrimaryLocationId option').eq(index).prop('selected', true);
                                                    $('#error').hide();
                                                    $("#SubLocationFirstId").prop('disabled', false);
                                                    $("#SubLocationSecondId").prop('disabled', false);
                                                },
                                                error: function () {
                                                    alert("Something Went Wrong.");
                                                }
                                            });
                                        }


                                    },
                                    error: function () {
                                        alert("Something Went Wrong.");
                                    }
                                });
                            }

                        }

                    },
                    error: function () {
                        alert("Something Went Wrong.");
                    }
                });
            }
        });
    });


    $("#PrimaryLocationId").change(function () {

        var id = $("#PrimaryLocationId").val();
        $.ajax({
            type: 'POST',
            url: "/EquipmentMaintenance/GetSecoundLocationsManually/" + id,
            success: function (data) {

                $("#SubLocationFirstId").empty();
                $("#SubLocationSecondId").empty();

                if (data === '') {
                    $("#SubLocationFirstId").prop('disabled', true);
                    $("#SubLocationSecondId").prop('disabled', true);
                } else {
                    $("#SubLocationFirstId").prop('disabled', false);
                    $("#SubLocationSecondId").prop('disabled', false);

                    $.each(data.locations,
                        function (i, row) {
                            $("#SubLocationFirstId")
                                .append("<option value='" + row.Value + "'>" + row.Text + "</option>");
                        });
                }

            },
            error: function () {
                alert("Something Went Wrong.");
            }
        });

    });


    $("#SubLocationFirstId").change(function () {

        var id = $("#SubLocationFirstId").val();

        $.ajax({
            type: 'POST',
            url: "/EquipmentMaintenance/GetthirdLocationsManually/" + id,
            success: function (data) {

                $("#SubLocationSecondId").empty();

                if (data === '') {
                    $("#SubLocationSecondId").prop('disabled', true);
                } else {
                    $("#SubLocationSecondId").prop('disabled', false);
                    $.each(data.locations,
                        function (i, row) {
                            $("#SubLocationSecondId")
                                .append("<option value='" + row.Value + "'>" + row.Text + "</option>");
                        });
                }
            },
            error: function () {
                alert("Something Went Wrong.");
            }
        });


    });


</script>